# xrandr --output HEADLESS-1 --off, captured 2026-09-10 THROUGH the proxy: sway (headless, one HEADLESS-1 at
# 1280x720) -> Xwayland 24.1.10 -> `python3 -m xw11 --foreground` -> the
# recording forwarder scratchpad/b7/rec.py -> xrandr 1.5.3. RANDR major 139,
# root 0x234, crtc 0x20, output 0x21.
#
# grab, disable (mode None, no outputs), SetScreenSize(16x16), ungrab, sync.
#
# Exit status 0, and sway's own outputs afterwards: HEADLESS-1 inactive.
# Captured through the proxy rather than against Xwayland directly because
# these are the streams a write path sends when nothing REFUSES it: against
# Xwayland alone, the SetScreenSize draws BadMatch and xrandr dies with a disable and no enable
# 22 requests, one per line.
